# Inputs for `npm run verification:fixtures` and `npm run verification:generate`.
# These regenerate the frozen scientific report from the official IGN/CNIG
# eclipse products. Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and set absolute local
# paths. Regeneration is a maintainer operation; the application and CI only read
# the committed report, so most contributors never need these.
#
# Obtain the three official IGN source files from the CNIG download page:
#   https://centrodedescargas.cnig.es/CentroDescargas/detalleArchivo?sec=12631995
# The generator verifies each file against a frozen SHA-256 and fails closed on a
# mismatch, so the exact published products are required:
#   10BANDS_2026_3857_COG.TIFF  547d772490b5080f6f423ccef382a78ba5a235791cd7234b5060724e77b4baa0
#   ECLIPSES.GPKG               4bc79c4c2e3692a1105cd9d415f5f10f1b4076af8ad14f9cf48169ec070b8944
#   Descripcion_eclipses.pdf    d0004551b07fa21cfc91bcc563c299d030725d29f5e6e4ee76ed846a6c7fd954

ECLIPSE_ATLAS_IGN_2026_RASTER=/absolute/path/to/10BANDS_2026_3857_COG.TIFF
ECLIPSE_ATLAS_IGN_2026_DESCRIPTION=/absolute/path/to/Descripcion_eclipses.pdf
ECLIPSE_ATLAS_IGN_2026_VECTOR=/absolute/path/to/ECLIPSES.GPKG

# Writable cache for the TerrainRGB and MDT05 fixtures that
# `npm run verification:fixtures` downloads from the IGN/CNIG services. Keep it
# outside version control.
ECLIPSE_ATLAS_FIXTURE_DIRECTORY=/absolute/path/to/ign-fixture-cache
